# NOTE: ESLint 9 uses flat config (`eslint.config.mjs`) — the `ignores` array
# in that file is the authoritative ignore list. This file is kept for
# compatibility with any tooling that still consults `.eslintignore`
# (e.g. eslint v8 invoked directly, or editor integrations that probe it).
#
# Keep both lists in sync.

